2026-07-27T09:12:45.3123917Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T09:12:45.3124561Z i /tmp/RtmpPMKToY/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:12:45.3124876Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:12:45.3125243Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:12:45.3125568Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:12:45.3126074Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:12:45.3126852Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:12:45.3127756Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
